  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can exploit any gap in your foe’s defenses, and at extreme range.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Greater Snap Shot<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you hit with an attack of opportunity using a ranged weapon, you add a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on the damage roll and on rolls to confirm a critical hit with that attack. You may instead expend one use of your mythic power to automatically confirm the critical hit.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc154\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
